B.a1E=new A.S(B.co,["dome_rock","Dome of the Rock","Iconic gold-domed shrine in the center of the compound.","The Dome of the Rock is an Islamic shrine located at the center of the Al-Aqsa Mosque compound. It was completed in 691 CE and is believed to enshrine the rock from which Prophet Muhammad ascended to heaven during the Isra and Mi\u2019raj.",B.Xz,340,210,"Mosque"],t.yf)
